Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:25.10,H_fil,,0,0,0,,"The elders dared to bully my MOTHER." ... "If you want the throne, SAY IT. Don't use a child as an excuse."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:25.10,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Sinaktan ng matanda ang INA KO!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:03.98,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Labis-labis na 'tong batang 'to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:15.20,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pinabayaan mo ang Dark Phoenix na wasakin ang ancestral land,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:17.20,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at nalanta ang ancestral tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.24,0:00:19.20,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka na karapat-dapat maging reyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:23.09,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kung trono ang habol mo, sabihin mo na.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.09,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Huwag ang bata ang idahilan.
